        "description": "<p>Bouncers are humans genetically adapted for zero-g and microgravity environments. Their legs are more limber, and their feet can grasp as well as their hands.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Morph Recognition Guide, p. 13.</em></p>"
